| Column           | Meaning                                                  | Example                          |
| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |
| `step`           | Time/transaction step                                    | `1` = first time period          |
| `type`           | Transaction ka type                                      | `PAYMENT`, `TRANSFER`            |
| `amount`         | Transaction amount                                       | `₹5000`                          |
| `nameOrig`       | Paisa bhejne wale ka ID                                  | `C12345`                         |
| `oldbalanceOrg`  | Sender ka transaction se **pehle balance**               | ₹10,000                          |
| `newbalanceOrig` | Sender ka transaction ke **baad balance**                | ₹5,000                           |
| `nameDest`       | Paisa receive karne wale ka ID                           | `C67890`                         |
| `oldbalanceDest` | Receiver ka **pehle balance**                            | ₹2,000                           |
| `newbalanceDest` | Receiver ka **baad balance**                             | ₹7,000                           |
| `isFraud`        | Transaction fraud hai ya nahi — **Target**               | `1 = Fraud`, `0 = Normal`        |
| `isFlaggedFraud` | System ne transaction ko fraud ke liye flag kiya ya nahi | `1 = Flagged`, `0 = Not flagged` |



